.TH MULTIFLEXI-TUI 1 "October 2026" "multiflexi-tui 3.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
multiflexi-tui \- Turbo Vision terminal UI for MultiFlexi
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B multiflexi-tui
[\fB\-\-cli=\fIPATH\fR]
[\fB\-\-envfile=\fIPATH\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBmultiflexi-tui\fR is a Turbo Vision (tvision) front-end for
\fBmultiflexi-cli\fR. It provides keyboard-driven browsing and editing of
MultiFlexi entities (companies, applications, run templates, jobs, credentials,
users, events, and more), plus activation/credential wizards and live job
output streaming via polling \fBjob:get\fR.
.PP
Lists support a filter field and an optional active company scope. Forms offer
relation pickers for foreign-key fields. CLI calls for list refresh and job
streams are drained asynchronously so the UI stays responsive.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-cli= PATH
Path to the multiflexi-cli binary (default: multiflexi-cli on PATH, or
\fBMULTIFLEXI_TUI_CLI\fR).
.TP
.BI \-\-envfile= PATH
Pass \fB\-\-envfile=\fIPATH\fR through to multiflexi-cli.
.SH SEE ALSO
multiflexi-cli(1)
.SH AUTHOR
Vitex Software <info@vitexsoftware.cz>
